  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower Cambodian children with English language</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enable 200 underprivileged children to receive quality, low-cost English lessons and become proficient in reading, writing, listening and speaking. ODC employs and trains local teachers and also provides teacher-training scholarships and academic scholarships to students from low-income families. We believe that a good English education will offer greater opportunities for higher education and employment, empower individuals and help combat inequality.</narrative>
  </description>
